/ Input: 10
/ Test 8: sum 1 + 2 + ... + n (labels used before they are defined)
        Input
        Store N
        Clear
        Store Sum
Loop,   Load N
        Skipcond 400       / N = 0: finished
        Jump Add1
        Jump Done
Add1,   Load Sum
        Add N
        Store Sum
        Load N
        Subt One
        Store N
        Jump Loop
Done,   Load Sum
        Output
        Halt
N,      Dec 0
Sum,    Dec 0
One,    Dec 1
